{"id":148,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"This Pokémon gathers power in the orbs on its tail and controls the weather. When enshrouded by an aura, Dragonair has a mystical appearance."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon lives in pristine oceans and lakes. It can control the weather, and it uses this power to fly into the sky, riding on the wind."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"According to a witness, its body was surrounded by a strange aura that gave it a mystical look."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Some say that if you see it at the start of the year, flying through the sky and twisting its body, you’ll be healthy all year long."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Lakes where Dragonair live are filled with offerings from people, because they believe this Pokémon is able to control the weather."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"From time immemorial, it has been venerated by agricultural peoples as an entity able to control the weather."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It has long been thought that its crystalline orbs are imbued with the power to control the weather."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Dragonair stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter weather conditions in its vicinity by discharging energy from the crystals on its neck and tail."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen"],"text":"A mystical Pokémon that exudes a gentle aura. It is said to have the ability to change the weather."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Its crystalline orbs appear to give this Pokémon the power to freely control the weather."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"They say that if it emits an aura from its whole body, the weather will begin to change instantly."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"It is said to live in seas and lakes. Even though it has no wings, it has been seen flying occasionally."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A DRAGONAIR stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter the weather around it by loosing energy from the crystals on its neck and tail."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It is called the divine POKéMON. When its entire body brightens slightly, the weather changes."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"A mystical POKéMON that exudes a gentle aura. Has the ability to change climate conditions."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Shed Skin","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may cure its own status conditions by shedding its skin."},{"name":"Marvel Scale","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's marvelous scales boost its Defense stat if it has a status condition."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Blue","shape":"Squiggle","evolution":{"id":147,"name":"Dratini","condition":null,"children":[{"id":148,"name":"Dragonair","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[{"id":149,"name":"Dragonite","condition":"Lv. 55","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,35],[1,43],[1,86],[1,239],[15,525],[20,97],[25,21],[33,401],[39,407],[46,219],[53,240],[60,349],[67,200],[74,63]],"machine":[97,59,34,784,886,434,913,349,406,525,203,263,126,83,53,416,114,270,56,63,58,196,442,113,200,182,240,156,799,214,164,241,57,129,36,851,87,86,85,352,127,311],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv3pt5-181","name":"Dragonair","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"181","artist":"rika","img":"sv3pt5/181"},{"id":"me2pt5-151","name":"Dragonair","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"151","artist":"Gemi","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-151/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-151/large"},{"id":"sv3pt5-148","name":"Dragonair","s